  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mn>0</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Adding, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
